menu "EDIT HERE: Zeitmessanlage configuration"
    config NUM_SENSORS_REQUIRED_FOR_TRIGGER
        int "Default sensors required for trigger"
        range 1 10
        default 2
        help
            Fallback used when num_s_req has not yet been provisioned in NVS.
            The stored NVS value is authoritative at runtime.
    config NUM_FAKE_SENSORS
        int "Default XLR virtual sensor count"
        range 1 64
        default 5
        help
            Fallback used when num_fake_s has not yet been provisioned in NVS.
            The stored NVS value is authoritative at runtime.
endmenu
